OSKit String Library

Utilities not found in POSIX string.h.

    module oskit.lib

    import posix.string.strlen

streq(a, b) — Compare two null-terminated strings.
Returns 1 if equal, 0 otherwise.

    streq(a: *i8, b: *i8) -> int
        if strlen(a) != strlen(b)
            return 0
        for var i = 0; a[i] != 0; i++
            if a[i] != b[i]
                return 0
        1
